This ledger is RETIRED. The fund lives on the phone.

Moved 2026-09-10: 55 events exported, transferred and imported on device,
every regenerated hash compared against the exported one.

Recording anything here would FORK the chain. Both databases share a history,
the ledger is append-only over a hash chain, and a fork cannot be merged —
importLedger compares every hash and refuses a mismatch by design.

Reads are still allowed (status, verify, ledger, items, export) because until
a backup has actually left the phone, data/resale.db is the fund's only other
copy. Deleting it would trade a fork risk for a loss risk.

Delete this file to undo, deliberately.
